{"3876920": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Hello Anxiety", "steam_appid": 3876920, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Hello Anxiety</i> is the first chapter in an upcoming series of narrative puzzle RPGs that explore mental health through atmospheric storytelling and symbolic environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed in detailed pixel art with a focus on mood and meaning, <i>Hello Anxiety</i> invites players to reflect on their own minds while guiding a young character through theirs.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handcrafted pixel art environments, rich with atmosphere and emotional depth <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876920/extras/04581d95ea22dd47b6d11befbcb0e378.poster.avif?t=1787727134\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876920/extras/04581d95ea22dd47b6d11befbcb0e378.webm?t=1787727134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876920/extras/04581d95ea22dd47b6d11befbcb0e378.mp4?t=1787727134\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surreal puzzles woven into metaphorical spaces-nothing is just what it seems</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876920/extras/9bdd16ecf1c8010c98fbbbb3ade70635.poster.avif?t=1787727134\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876920/extras/9bdd16ecf1c8010c98fbbbb3ade70635.webm?t=1787727134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876920/extras/9bdd16ecf1c8010c98fbbbb3ade70635.mp4?t=1787727134\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A haunting yet hopeful journey through anxiety.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876920/extras/2626be9f3c2b5d79d95bb023708c15f7.poster.avif?t=1787727134\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876920/extras/2626be9f3c2b5d79d95bb023708c15f7.webm?t=1787727134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876920/extras/2626be9f3c2b5d79d95bb023708c15f7.mp4?t=1787727134\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration-driven gameplay that lets you uncover hidden thoughts and buried fears.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876920/extras/e2e1f3c3dac18b0fdd35f0855b26c1b0.poster.avif?t=1787727134\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876920/extras/e2e1f3c3dac18b0fdd35f0855b26c1b0.webm?t=1787727134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876920/extras/e2e1f3c3dac18b0fdd35f0855b26c1b0.mp4?t=1787727134\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is just the beginning. <i>Hello Anxiety</i> is part of a larger vision to create episodic games that each explore different aspects of mental health, one chapter at a time.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Hello Anxiety</i> is the first chapter in an upcoming series of narrative puzzle RPGs that explore mental health thro